            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "anykoi"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The best! I made up some of this, stored it in sealed container, sprinkle over fish (usually tilapia), and put it on the George Foreman grill. The kids love it1. I thought I had lost the recipe (until I found that I had smartly saved it in my recipe box) and the kids were upset. They said, \"Mom, you HAVE to get more of this!\"",
            "datePublished": "2013-08-21T16:38:27.657Z"
